        "en": "Attentive and compassionate veterinary doctors"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners speak warmly of Dr. Heather Oyan, Dr. Grossman, and the veterinary technicians for their patient, thorough, and empathetic approach. Reviewers note that the veterinary team listens carefully to medical concerns without rushing through appointments. Staff members take time to explain treatment plans and medication choices in clear, reassuring detail."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 21,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling for multiple pet species"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently remark on how calm and gentle the clinic staff are with dogs, cats, and avian companions during examinations. Several owners of nervous or elderly pets describe how comfortable their animals felt with the technicians. Pet parents emphasize the team genuine affection for animals, making stressful veterinary visits significantly easier."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 7,
      "title": {
        "en": "Thorough diagnostic and medical care"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers report excellent diagnostic outcomes and effective medical treatments for acute infections, routine wellness checkups, and senior pet management. Many longtime clients credit the doctors with maintaining their pets health and quality of life over multiple years. Pet families express strong trust in the hospital clinical recommendations and care standards."
      }
    }
